ctor_databases/readme","line":378},{"title":"“Instruct the model to use retrieved knowledge to answer queries”","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-instruct-the-model-to-answer-using-a-reference-text","line":378},{"title":"Tactic: Use code execution to perform more accurate calculations or call external APIs","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-use-code-execution-to-perform-more-accurate-calculations-or-call-external-apis","line":382},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-code-execution?mode=chat","line":390},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-code-api?mode=chat","line":396},{"title":"Тактика: дайте модели доступ к определенным функциям.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-give-the-model-access-to-specific-functions","line":402},{"title":"примеры вызова функций","target":"https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/how_to_call_functions_with_chat_models","line":404},{"title":"раздел «Вызов функций»","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/function-calling","line":404},{"title":"Стратегия: систематическое тестирование изменений.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/strategy-test-changes-systematically","line":408},{"title":"OpenAI Evals","target":"https://github.com/openai/evals","line":425},{"title":"Тактика: Оцените результаты модели со ссылкой на ответы «золотого стандарта».","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-evaluate-model-outputs-with-reference-to-gold-standard-answers","line":431},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/strategy-test-changes-systematically?mode=chat","line":439},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-mod